      "kind": "list",
      "start_line": 44,
      "end_line": 60,
      "raw": "- 헤더 파생 카운터:\n  - `totalFolders`\n  - `totalTags`\n- 본문 파생 카운터:\n  - `letterCount`\n  - `wordCount`\n  - `sentenceCount`\n  - `paragraphCount`\n  - `spaceCount`\n  - `indentCount`\n  - `lineCount`\n  - `backlinkToCount`\n  - `backlinkByCount`\n  - `includedResourceCount`\n- 런타임 카운터:\n  - `openCount`\n  - `modifiedCount`\n",
      "items": [
